<template name="tus_settings_scale_Machinedrum">
<head>
</head>
<body>
	<div class="settings-page">
		<h1>Scale Quantizer</h1>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<label>With a scale on, the PTCH encoder (A on the SYNTHESIS page) of a pitched machine steps through scale degrees, every randomize gesture keeps PTCH in key, and FUNCTION + click on encoder A snaps the track's existing PTCH locks to the scale. Tracks set to TONAL in the X firmware are always supported.</label>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div class="settings-hlayout">
			<label>Scale</label>
			<combo class="settings-combo" id="cbScaleQuantizer"/>
		</div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
		<div class="settings-hlayout">
			<label>Root</label>
			<combo class="settings-combo" id="cbScaleRoot"/>
		</div>
		<settingsspacer1/>
	</div>
</body>
</template>
